description: Agent contract for this repo
alwaysApply: true
---

Single script list: `js/scripts.js`. New domain files go there, in load order.

Tests live in `test/` and must not ship in `GAME_SCRIPTS.browser`. Run `npm test`.

Rules / To-do text lives only in `RULES.md` / `TODO.md`.

Do not delete `afterPlayerAction` in `js/turn.js`. No sounds.

Defense only. Into the Breach holdout: 1 opening vek, city beeline, never empty-air intent, cap 3, one hole per enemy phase. Four off-field. Summon is a spell (1 mana). 1 move + 1 attack per wizard per turn. Stock 1/1/1 free. Spell 1 after 1 kill, spell 2 after 2. Mana cap 6. Named missions live in `js/domain/missions.js`.

Do not re-add Vs.

Read `AGENTS.md` (file map) before changing load order, docs, or Defense AI.
